SUMMARY:SALSA Tuesdays at Cobble Fish
DESCRIPTION:DJ John John presents SALSA Tuesdays at Cobble Fish * Pier 16 * South Street Seaport * NYC * OUTDOOR EVENT each and every Tuesday | No Cover\n\n\nHola mi gente\, \nWE’RE BACK!  \nSALSA Tuesdays by Pier 16 at Cobble Fish” located at the South Street Seaport each and every Tuesday from 7:00 pm to 11:00 with NO COVER CHARGE starting CINCO DE MAYO. \nWhat’s a summer in NYC without dancing outdoors to your favorite salsa tunes overlooking the beautiful Brooklyn skyline as you enjoy some delicious refreshments and food from the iconic Cobble Fish restaurant located at 89 South Street at Pier 16. \nThis is a FREE OUTDOOR EVENT/NO COVER\, with that said\, this is also a restaurant/venue hosting this event and they do expect and encourage customers to consume. To assure they do there will be a suggested 2 Drink minimum or 1 Food item requirement when seating. \nLet’s spread the word and enjoy the great weather while we have it. \nDate: Each and every Tuesday (STARTING CINCO DE MAYO) \nTime: 7:00 pm to 11:00 pm \nMusic by “El Boricua del Sabor” DJ John John & Friends.
URL:https://golatindance.com/event/salsa-tuesdays-at-cobble-fish/2026-07-07/
LOCATION:Cobble Fish\, 89 South Street\, New York\, NY 10038\, Manhattan\, NY\, 10038\, United States
CATEGORIES:New York City
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://golatindance.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/306718_image.png
END:VEVENT
